# Secrets the walkthroughs write into the checkout: QUICKSTART tier 2's recovery.key, the
# tier-1 ceremony's output (backup.age, keeper-*.json with spend keys), an age identity, a
# keeper's spend.key. Never commit any of them.
*.key
/ceremony/
# QUICKSTART's bin/sigelo-agent wrapper (it holds the checkout's absolute path)
/bin/
# What QUICKSTART's steps write into the checkout root (the agent's genesis, the mock world's
# challenge and attestation, the signed answer, bundles; the world's own state is *.local.json
# above), and examples/world.mjs's lock, left behind if a run is killed.
/agent-genesis.json
/answer.json
/bundle*.json
/challenge*.json
/issued*.json
/recovery.pub
/signed*.json
world.lock
